cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the paper below."
title: "IM2PROP"
abstract: >-
  A tri-branch deep learning regression framework that predicts local
  Micro-Vickers hardness of S32205 duplex stainless steel directly from real
  optical microscope images, fusing a MicroNet-pretrained ResNet50 encoder,
  a phase-driven spatial attention mechanism derived from binary phase masks,
  and macroscopic phase ratio inputs.
type: software
license: MIT
